overpowered. As Toby has said, it's like finding the very best item in
the game--and never a redundant one. If there is no rationale behind 7
wishes, what is the rationale behind 3? Or 1? If there is no rationale
behind wands of wishing, what is the rationale behind wishes from
djinn?

